# arms/adult/action/body/arm_l: the left arm of the roll and the cast (ACTIONS-BODY, P2c wave 2; STYLE_P2 25.8 items 8-9).
# GENERATED from the area's grids (src/build_maps.py in the area's root); keys rl* (the roll) and cs* (the cast), contracts 4.
# Both fists work together in every frame: `mark grip` here (the right fist, every facing), `gripL` on arm_l on the held
# weapon's line, so one drawing serves the one-handed families, the two-handed hafts (C3d) and empty hands. The cast's
# gather carries the glow (Fx C B A) over the joined fists. Regions U F C H as the arm library. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role arms std
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys armL
side L

